    "body": "I had a quick look at this and I think the problem is the use of [`from_str_radix`](https://doc.rust-lang.org/std/primitive.u8.html#method.from_str_radix) in [`src/config.rs`](https://github.com/starship/starship/blob/master/src/config.rs#L387-L389) which panics if the radix is out of range e.g (`#00000`). I've not had time to look at fixing and probably won't for a little while so if someone else wants to continue the investigation/fix please do. ",
